cosmic-epoch-monorepo (1.0.15-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * New upstream release: Cosmic Epoch 1.0.15.
    - cosmic-comp: Support multiple fullscreen windows per workspace (fixes
      Steam Big Picture).
    - cosmic-comp: Implement pointer constraints protocol for better gaming
      cursor behavior.
    - Applets: Fixed tray icons for apps like Dropbox.
    - Applets: Resolved Bluetooth "off" reporting bug.
    - Applets: Fixed panic in battery applet.
    - Terminal: New option to open windows in current directory.
    - Terminal: Increased default scroll history to 100,000 lines.
    - Store: Added local RPM package support.
    - Player: Added playback speed configuration.

 -- Ritesh Raj Sarraf <rrs@debian.org>  Thu, 04 Jun 2026 10:26:00 +0530

cosmic-epoch-monorepo (1.0.14-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * New upstream release: Cosmic Epoch 1.0.14.
    - Key bind support for non-latin keyboard layouts.
    - Progress bar supports linear progress markers for volume OSD.
    - Fix missing icons in apps sourcing custom theme paths.
    - Fix window resize crash in X11 environment.
    - Prevent potential hang in cosmic-app-library with double fork exit fix.
    - Enable F16 shader only if the GPU reports support for it.
    - Applets gracefully exit when Wayland pipe drops.

 -- Ritesh Raj Sarraf <rrs@debian.org>  Wed, 27 May 2026 11:04:52 +0530

